Semantic snake eyes. One die is what the action did. The other is what the follow-through made it mean.

Leo swings and misses. If he freezes where the bat passed the ball, you see a miss. If he swings all the way through, you might see a kid who finally committed to the swing. Same strike. Different thing to praise.

And it loops. What you praise after this swing becomes part of what he aims for before the next one. The follow-through can’t reach back and hit the ball. It can reach forward into the next swing.